      "version": 1,
      "summary": "Repair-1: only format:check failed. The baseline AGENTS.md shipped with a doubled blank line, and format:auto only rewrites changed/untracked files, so the untouched file still failed the whole-tree prettier check. Removed the extra blank line; format:check, lint, typecheck and the IT-request tests now pass.",
      "blockers": [],
      "issues": [
        {
          "phase": "verify",
          "title": "format:check fails on the untouched baseline AGENTS.md",
          "symptom": "`pnpm format:check '!.github/**'` warns on AGENTS.md and exits 1, so verify halts before lint/typecheck/test/build and the browser smoke. The failure feedback contains no browser observations because those stages never ran.",
          "rootCause": "AGENTS.md as shipped in the workspace (and identically in the factory's control/AGENTS.md) contains a doubled blank line before the '## Controlled failed-delivery smoke' section. `.github/scripts/format-changes.mjs` runs prettier --write only over git-changed and untracked files, so an unmodified baseline file is never normalized, while `format:check` still checks the whole tree. Because the feature work only added business files under client/, server/, database/ and tests/, AGENTS.md stayed unchanged and unformatted.",
          "resolution": "Removed the single extra blank line in AGENTS.md so the file matches prettier output. Verified `pnpm format:check '!.github/**'` exits 0, and re-ran lint (exit 0), typecheck (exit 0), and the affected tests (app-server, client-routes, it-permission-sets, it-requests-locales, it-ticket-rules, it-ticket-form, locale-coverage: 7 files / 64 tests passed). No application behavior changed.",
          "status": "resolved"
        }
      ],
      "improvements": [
        {
          "category": "framework",
          "title": "Baseline source is not prettier-clean while format:auto skips unchanged files",
          "detail": "control/AGENTS.md and the generated workspace AGENTS.md carry a formatting violation (a doubled blank line). format-changes.mjs normalizes only git-changed and untracked files, so a baseline tracked file is never fixed automatically, yet format:check inspects every non-ignored file. Any task whose diff does not happen to touch AGENTS.md fails the first required check and never reaches the later checks or the browser smoke.",
          "suggestedChange": "Format control/AGENTS.md and the app-template AGENTS.md so the refresh baseline is prettier-clean, or have format-changes.mjs also normalize baseline files that format:check covers, or add intentionally-unmanaged baseline documents to .prettierignore.",
          "mechanizable": true
        }
      ]
    },
    "acceptanceRequirements": "B01. 员工甲提交一张工单，刷新后仍可从自己的列表打开。\n\nB02. 员工乙登录后，列表中没有甲的工单；直接打开甲的工单链接也看不到内容，且不能进行处理人员的操作。\n\nB03. 处理人员找到该单并开始处理，刷新后状态为“处理中”，处理人正确。\n\nB04. 未填写处理说明不能完成；填写后完成，刷新确认状态和说明正确，不能再修改或重复完成。\n\nB05. 切回员工甲，可看到完成结果；按不同状态筛选，结果与工单真实状态一致。",
